    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Since there are so many types of weapons, there are an equally large number of ammunition types. Depending upon the weapon the wearer carries, a Bandolier may contain any number or form of ammunition. </p><p>A Bandolier has 12 slots that can each hold a single Tiny weapon (such as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grenade\">Grenade</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knife\" title=\"Knife\">knife</a>), or single piece of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> weighing up to 0.5 kg. Any item on the Bandolier can be retrieved as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a>. </p><p>No items come stocked on a standard Bandolier, as they do with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Utility_Belt\" title=\"Utility Belt\">Utility Belt</a>. </p>",
